{"seq":4,"slug":"few-shot-classification","title":"小样本分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/image-classification/few-shot-classification","wordCount":1351,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"小样本分类\">小样本分类</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>小样本分类（Few-Shot Classification）旨在解决&quot;如何仅用少量标注样本学会识别新类别&quot;的问题。传统深度学习模型需要大量标注数据才能有效训练，而人类仅凭几张甚至一张图片就能识别新物体。小样本学习试图弥合这一差距，使模型具备快速学习新概念的能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[支持集 Support Set] --&gt; B{小样本模型}&#10;    C[查询集 Query Set] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; D[相似度计算]&#10;    D --&gt; E[类别预测]&#10;    subgraph N-way K-shot&#10;        F[N 个类别]&#10;        G[每类 K 个样本]&#10;    end&#10;    F --&gt; A&#10;    G --&gt; A\">graph LR\n    A[支持集 Support Set] --&gt; B{小样本模型}\n    C[查询集 Query Set] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; D[相似度计算]\n    D --&gt; E[类别预测]\n    subgraph N-way K-shot\n        F[N 个类别]\n        G[每类 K 个样本]\n    end\n    F --&gt; A\n    G --&gt; A</pre><p>小样本分类的标准设置是 N-way K-shot：从未见过的类别中选取 N 个类，每个类只提供 K 个标注样本（支持集），模型需要对新的查询样本进行分类。常见的设置包括 5-way 1-shot（5 类各 1 样本）和 5-way 5-shot（5 类各 5 样本）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法类型</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>度量学习</td>\n<td>Prototypical Net, Matching Net</td>\n<td>学习嵌入空间+距离比较</td>\n<td>简单高效，可解释</td>\n<td>嵌入质量依赖预训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>元学习</td>\n<td>MAML, Meta-SGD</td>\n<td>学习快速适应的初始化</td>\n<td>理论优雅</td>\n<td>训练不稳定，计算量大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据增强</td>\n<td>Delta-encoder, Hallucinator</td>\n<td>生成新样本扩充数据</td>\n<td>直觉直接</td>\n<td>生成质量影响效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提示学习</td>\n<td>CoOp, CLIP-Adapter</td>\n<td>利用预训练视觉-语言模型</td>\n<td>无需大量微调</td>\n<td>依赖强大的基础模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"度量学习方法\">度量学习方法</h2><p>度量学习是小样本分类中最直观也最实用的方法族。核心思路是学习一个嵌入空间，在该空间中同类样本距离近、异类样本距离远，然后通过最近邻或原型比较进行分类。</p>\n<p>Prototypical Networks 是度量学习方法的经典代表。它为每个类别计算支持集样本嵌入的均值作为类原型（prototype），查询样本通过与各类原型的欧氏距离进行分类。Prototypical Networks 简单高效且效果出色，是小样本分类的标准基线。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;import torch.nn.functional as F&#10;&#10;class PrototypicalNet(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, encoder):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.encoder = encoder&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, support, query, n_way, k_shot):&#10;        support_emb = self.encoder(support)&#10;        query_emb = self.encoder(query)&#10;&#10;        support_emb = support_emb.view(n_way, k_shot, -1)&#10;        prototypes = support_emb.mean(dim=1)&#10;&#10;        dists = torch.cdist(query_emb, prototypes)&#10;        logits = -dists&#10;        return logits&#10;&#10;def episodic_training(model, data_loader, optimizer, n_way=5, k_shot=1, n_query=15):&#10;    model.train()&#10;    for support, query, labels in data_loader:&#10;        logits = model(support, query, n_way, k_shot)&#10;        loss = F.cross_entropy(logits, labels)&#10;        optimizer.zero_grad()&#10;        loss.backward()&#10;        optimizer.step()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.functional </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PrototypicalNet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, encoder):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, support, query, n_way, k_shot):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        support_emb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder(support)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        query_emb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder(query)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        support_emb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> support_emb.view(n_way, k_shot, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prototypes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> support_emb.mean(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dists </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cdist(query_emb, prototypes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dists</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> episodic_training</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(model, data_loader, optimizer, n_way</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, k_shot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n_query</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model.train()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> support, query, labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data_loader:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(support, query, n_way, k_shot)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.cross_entropy(logits, labels)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        optimizer.zero_grad()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        loss.backward()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        optimizer.step()</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 支持集编码&#10;        A1[类1样本] --&gt; E1[嵌入1]&#10;        A2[类2样本] --&gt; E2[嵌入2]&#10;        A3[类3样本] --&gt; E3[嵌入3]&#10;    end&#10;    E1 --&gt; P1[原型1]&#10;    E2 --&gt; P2[原型2]&#10;    E3 --&gt; P3[原型3]&#10;    subgraph 查询分类&#10;        Q[查询样本] --&gt; QE[查询嵌入]&#10;        QE --&gt; D{距离计算}&#10;        P1 --&gt; D&#10;        P2 --&gt; D&#10;        P3 --&gt; D&#10;        D --&gt; C[预测类别]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 支持集编码\n        A1[类1样本] --&gt; E1[嵌入1]\n        A2[类2样本] --&gt; E2[嵌入2]\n        A3[类3样本] --&gt; E3[嵌入3]\n    end\n    E1 --&gt; P1[原型1]\n    E2 --&gt; P2[原型2]\n    E3 --&gt; P3[原型3]\n    subgraph 查询分类\n        Q[查询样本] --&gt; QE[查询嵌入]\n        QE --&gt; D{距离计算}\n        P1 --&gt; D\n        P2 --&gt; D\n        P3 --&gt; D\n        D --&gt; C[预测类别]\n    end</pre><p>Matching Networks 使用注意力机制代替简单的最近邻，为支持集中每个样本分配不同权重。Relation Network 将距离度量替换为可学习的关系网络，通过 CNN 学习两个嵌入之间的相似度函数，理论上能捕获比欧氏距离更复杂的关系。</p>\n<p>嵌入网络的质量是度量学习方法的关键。使用在大规模数据集上预训练的强大编码器（如 ResNet-12、ViT）作为嵌入网络，配合简单的 Prototypical Networks，通常就能达到非常好的效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"maml-与元学习\">MAML 与元学习</h2><p>MAML（Model-Agnostic Meta-Learning）从元学习的视角解决小样本问题。其核心思想是：学习一组模型参数初始化，使得从这个初始化出发，仅需少量梯度更新步骤就能快速适应任何新任务。</p>\n<p>MAML 的训练过程包含内循环和外循环两层优化。内循环在每个 episode 的支持集上进行少量梯度下降步骤（通常 1-5 步），得到任务特定的参数；外循环则根据这些适应后的参数在查询集上的表现来更新元参数（初始化参数）。这种&quot;学习如何学习&quot;的范式使模型获得了快速适应新任务的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;import torch.nn.functional as F&#10;&#10;class MAML(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, model, inner_lr=0.01, inner_steps=5):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.model = model&#10;        self.inner_lr = inner_lr&#10;        self.inner_steps = inner_steps&#10;&#10;    def inner_loop(self, support_x, support_y):&#10;        fast_weights = {name: param.clone() for name, param in self.model.named_parameters()}&#10;&#10;        for _ in range(self.inner_steps):&#10;            logits = self.model.functional_forward(support_x, fast_weights)&#10;            loss = F.cross_entropy(logits, support_y)&#10;            grads = torch.autograd.grad(loss, fast_weights.values(), create_graph=True)&#10;            fast_weights = {&#10;                name: param - self.inner_lr * grad&#10;                for (name, param), grad in zip(fast_weights.items(), grads)&#10;            }&#10;        return fast_weights&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, support_x, support_y, query_x):&#10;        fast_weights = self.inner_loop(support_x, support_y)&#10;        query_logits = self.model.functional_forward(query_x, fast_weights)&#10;        return query_logits\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.functional </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MAML</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, model, inner_lr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, inner_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.inner_lr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inner_lr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.inner_steps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inner_steps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inner_loop</span><spa