ast_weights </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.inner_loop(support_x, support_y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        query_logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model.functional_forward(query_x, fast_weights)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query_logits</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MAML 的计算成本较高，因为外循环需要对内循环的梯度进行二阶求导。ANIL（Almost No Inner Loop）发现只需要对最后一层进行内循环更新就够了，大幅降低了计算量。Meta-SGD 进一步将内循环的学习率也作为可学习参数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>内循环</th>\n<th>二阶梯度</th>\n<th>计算量</th>\n<th>miniImageNet 5w1s</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MAML</td>\n<td>全网络更新</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>63.1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ANIL</td>\n<td>仅最后一层</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>61.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reptile</td>\n<td>多步 SGD</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>62.7%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meta-SGD</td>\n<td>可学习学习率</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>64.0%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基于预训练模型的提示学习\">基于预训练模型的提示学习</h2><p>随着 CLIP 等大规模视觉-语言预训练模型的出现，小样本分类迎来了新的范式。通过设计合适的提示（prompt），可以在几乎不修改模型参数的情况下将预训练模型适配到目标任务。</p>\n<p>CoOp（Context Optimization）将 CLIP 的文本提示从手工设计改为可学习的连续向量。只需要在少量标注样本上优化这些提示向量，就能显著提升 CLIP 在特定任务上的分类性能。CoCoOp 进一步引入了条件化机制，使提示能够根据输入图像动态调整。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class CoOpPromptLearner(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, clip_model, n_ctx=16, num_classes=10):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        ctx_dim = clip_model.text_encoder.embed_dim&#10;        self.ctx = nn.Parameter(torch.randn(n_ctx, ctx_dim))&#10;        self.class_token_ids = self._init_class_tokens(num_classes)&#10;        self.clip_model = clip_model&#10;&#10;    def forward(self):&#10;        ctx = self.ctx.unsqueeze(0).expand(len(self.class_token_ids), -1, -1)&#10;        class_embeddings = self.clip_model.token_embedding(self.class_token_ids)&#10;        prompts = torch.cat([ctx, class_embeddings], dim=1)&#10;        return prompts&#10;&#10;class CLIPAdapter(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, clip_model, alpha=0.2):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.clip_model = clip_model&#10;        self.alpha = alpha&#10;        self.adapter = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Linear(512, 128),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Linear(128, 512)&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, images, text_features):&#10;        image_features = self.clip_model.encode_image(images)&#10;        adapted = self.adapter(image_features)&#10;        image_features = self.alpha * adapted + (1 - self.alpha) * image_features&#10;        logits = image_features @ text_features.T&#10;        return logits\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CoOpPromptLearner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><sp