d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, images, text_features):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        image_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.clip_model.encode_image(images)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        adapted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.adapter(image_features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        image_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adapted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> image_features</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> image_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> text_features.T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logits</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CLIP-Adapter 和 Tip-Adapter 通过在 CLIP 的特征空间中添加轻量级适配层来实现小样本适应。这些方法仅需优化极少量参数（几千到几万个），在 1-shot 和 few-shot 设置下都展现出了优异的性能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((小样本分类))&#10;    度量学习&#10;      Prototypical Networks&#10;      Matching Networks&#10;      Relation Network&#10;    元学习&#10;      MAML&#10;      ANIL&#10;      Meta-SGD&#10;    提示学习&#10;      CoOp&#10;      CLIP-Adapter&#10;      Tip-Adapter\">mindmap\n  root((小样本分类))\n    度量学习\n      Prototypical Networks\n      Matching Networks\n      Relation Network\n    元学习\n      MAML\n      ANIL\n      Meta-SGD\n    提示学习\n      CoOp\n      CLIP-Adapter\n      Tip-Adapter</pre><ul>\n<li>小样本分类的标准设置是 N-way K-shot，通过 episode 训练评估模型的快速适应能力</li>\n<li>Prototypical Networks 是最实用的基线方法，配合强大的预训练编码器效果出色</li>\n<li>MAML 提供了优雅的元学习框架，但计算成本高且训练不稳定</li>\n<li>基于 CLIP 的提示学习方法代表了小样本分类的新范式，性能和效率都大幅领先</li>\n<li>实际项目中推荐优先尝试 CLIP + 提示学习/适配器方案</li>\n<li>嵌入网络的质量（预训练模型的选择）往往比学习算法本身更重要</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"小样本分类","id":"小样本分类"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"度量学习方法","id":"度量学习方法"},{"level":2,"text":"MAML 与元学习","id":"maml-与元学习"},{"level":2,"text":"基于预训练模型的提示学习","id":"基于预训练模型的提示学习"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"细粒度识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/image-classification/fine-grained-recognition"},"next":{"title":"两阶段检测器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/object-detection/two-stage-detectors"}}